# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Repo Migrator — No configuration file needed!
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# All credentials (tokens, repo names, destination details) are entered at
# runtime through the GUI dialogs when you run:
#
#     python main.py
#
# Credentials are never written to disk — they live only in memory for the
# duration of the run.
#
# Token scopes required
# ──────────────────────
# GitHub source token : repo, read:org
# GitHub dest token   : repo, workflow
# GitLab source token : api, read_repository
# GitLab dest token   : api, read_repository, write_repository
#
# Where to generate tokens
# ─────────────────────────
# GitHub : https://github.com/settings/tokens
# GitLab : https://gitlab.com/-/user_settings/personal_access_tokens
#          (or <your-instance>/profile/personal_access_tokens for self-hosted)
